# Brewfile — regenerated from the actual installed state on 2026-10-23.
#
# Notes:
#  * Mackup was deliberately removed from this setup. Symlinking macOS .plist
#    files into a synced folder breaks cfprefsd, which rewrites plists
#    atomically and replays stale cached settings. Use each app's own sync
#    (e.g. iTerm2's "load settings from a custom folder") instead.
#  * BOTH mysql clients are intentional: mysql-client@8.4 matches the MySQL
#    8.x servers DBngin runs, and is first on $PATH. brew's default
#    mysql-client is 9.x, which is incompatible with 8.0/8.4 servers
#    (mysqldump syntax, mysql_native_password).
#  * mackup was uninstalled on 2026-10-23 and is intentionally absent.

